# ROVEXO MASTER FULL WIDTH CONTRACT v1.1

**STATUS: PERMANENTLY LOCKED**

Applies to the **entire** Profile / Settings tree (and every menu / submenu / child page under AccountCanonicalShell) — not only Addresses, Settings, or Ideas.

## DESIGN DECISION #001 (Owner APPROVED · ROVEXO v1.1)

| Surface | L/R padding |
|---------|-------------|
| Homepage (marketing) | **24px** LOCKED |
| Internal application | **16px** |

SSOT: `lib/design-system/design-decision-001-internal-ui-v1.1.ts`

## Equation

```
PROFILE = MASTER DESIGN SYSTEM
+ 100% FULL WIDTH
+ ALL MENU PAGES
+ ALL SUBMENU PAGES
= FINAL IMPLEMENTATION
```

**P0 Design Protection Absolute v1.1:** Owner-approved design always wins. Full Width / Responsive / Adaptive (and Theme, A11y, AI, CSS overrides, hotfixes, Cursor) must **never** redesign it — only bug/perf/a11y/responsive/overflow/alignment/security/compat fixes. Same design on every device. See `design-protection-absolute-v1.mdc`.

## Tokens (SSOT)

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Header | 64px |
| Primary button | 56px |
| Radius | 16px |
| Width | **100% only** |
| Primary CTA | 100% |
| L/R padding (internal) | **16px** |
| L/R padding (Homepage) | **24px** |
| Top / section spacing | 24px |
| Input height | 56px |
| Touch target | ≥ 44px |

## Forbidden

70% · 80% · 85% · 90% · 95% · centered layouts · mini cards · floating containers · secondary layouts · secondary design systems.

## Required

Every page / modal / sheet / form / CTA under Profile or Settings: **100% width** + inherit Profile (typography, colours, radius, paddings, spacings, shadows, icons, touch targets, responsiveness, animations, buttons, forms, headers, menu rows, separators).

## Implementation

- SSOT: `lib/master-engine/master-full-width-contract-v1.ts`
- Engine CSS: `styles/rovexo/full-width-engine-v1.css`
- Shell: `AccountCanonicalShell` stamps `data-full-width-engine` + Profile master DOM
- Prefer `MyAccountTemplate` for surface tagging

## Agent duty

Scan → detect non-100% / non-Profile inheritance → **auto-fix** under this contract. No secondary design systems.
